I hold my bag tightly.
The cafe is very crowded.
I look all around.
I need an empty table.
Almost all the tables are full.
A small table near the window is empty.
I go there quickly.
I keep my bag securely on a chair.
Then I sit on the other chair.
There are big fans on the ceiling.
The fans run very slowly.
The breeze feels good.
This place is very old.
But the atmosphere here is very lively.
The wooden chairs and tables are beautiful.
A checkered cloth is spread on the table.
I like this old cafe a lot.
I look at the street outside.
Now I wait comfortably for my tea.
